# luci-app-campus-auth is LicenseRef-Proprietary and is built outside this
# GPL-2.0-only repository. The build fetches this exact APK and verifies its
# SHA-256 before adding it to the signed package index; nothing is compiled here.
# The APK lives under gh-pages repo/external/: release.yml clears every other
# top-level gh-pages entry, and repo-publish only replaces repo/<tag>/.
# When bumping: change the filename, the URL and the SHA256 together.
